  "description": "SearXSharp - The C#-adapted SearXNG meta-search engine. Vibe-coded for AI applications to avoid paid APIs!\n\nSearXSharp queries multiple search engines simultaneously, merges, deduplicates, and returns clean structured results. No API keys. No paid subscriptions. Just raw scraping power.\n\nFeatures:\n- 118+ search engines (Google, Bing, DuckDuckGo, YouTube, GitHub, Reddit and many more)\n- Parallel execution across all engines\n- Automatic deduplication and result merging\n- No API keys required\n- Privacy-respecting\n- Easy to use with DI or standalone",
